=== E. TOTAL RETURN: points scored while held + resale value ===
    Older producers lose price but pay you in points. Exchange rate (KTC value per point over the starter line)
    is read from the market itself: cell means (position x age band x price tier), price = a x points + b x resale.
  +1y: 1 point over the starter line = -2.9 KTC value, resale counts 1.16  (cells 51, fit R2 0.93)
  +2y: 1 point over the starter line = -2.5 KTC value, resale counts 1.35  (cells 48, fit R2 0.64)
  +3y: 1 point over the starter line = 0.9 KTC value, resale counts 1.49  (cells 42, fit R2 0.10)

